window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I can feel it. It floats beneath the surface, an endless well of power waiting to be unleashed.</b></p> <p>Magic I never thought I'd possess, and yet now that I do. I'm starting to wonder if it's more potent than I ever could've imagined. I need to learn my limits and fast because there's darkness on the horizon.</p> <p>My days at Silvercrest Academy have been filled with secrets, conflict, and death. It's a world consumed with uncertainty, but there's only one thing I can believe in… the Bishops.</p> <p>Creed, Zane, Eldon, and Brax. They're everything I never knew I needed, and I have a feeling the five of us together are the key to making it out of here alive. In this fight, it's kill or be killed.</p> <p>I hold the power in the palm of my hand.</p>"; 
